  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When using the new eyelook feature in the VRC Descriptor on two models i have tested so far it changes their rotation and completely offsets the eyes positions. The eye will either be rotated in a weird way where they aren't visible or they will be cross eyed on the model. A simple solution to this would allow for previous eye tracking methods or figuring out why it changes the rotation on the eyes.",
